Welcome to the first build of Ticketiv Access, the staff check-in app.

- Staff login and device pairing via short code
- Assign a device to an event
- Scan and validate tickets by QR code
- Offline validation with encrypted local manifests, syncing in the background
- Duplicate-entry warnings and live check-in totals per device

This is an early test build for gate staff - please report anything broken.
